  "description": "A word-size agnostic RISC architecture featuring a uniform 16-bit instruction format and a generalized bitwise boolean instruction set. The repository provides a comprehensive hardware-software co-design ecosystem, including RTL implementations in SpinalHDL and MyHDL, a Rust-based emulator with symbolic analysis capabilities, and custom compiler toolchains featuring automated register allocation.",
